699 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 524 0 R
/E (Resvita is a culmination of years of extensive research and real lived experience in what it takes to make a trade based business successful. Resvita was born from the desire to change the way tradies are building their businesses. Josh is the founder of 365 Property Services and it is worthwhile sharing the story of 365's history and key learnings.  )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
700 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 524 0 R
/E (365 Property Services grew too great heights in a very short period of time. It quickly became very successful in generating work and in the first 18 months generated over $3M worth of work. To support the fast growth - the excess cash was reinvested back into the business. Unfortunately in the early days they did not have the knowledge of how tax worked and \(as we now know\) like many other tradie businesses, it caused the business to collapse. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
701 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 524 0 R
/E (Josh then rebuilt the company, and by 2020, 365 Property Services grew to 68 employees over a 2 year period, and again due to a lack of culture and capability of the team, the business fell apart again and downsized to 12 people. During his time as director of the company Josh grew and collapsed the business back multiple times, each time learning new skills and analysing what had gone wrong.  )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
702 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 524 0 R
/E (Josh then began to help other businesses, coaching small business owners in the construction industry. He began to see patterns of where people were going wrong and making the same mistakes as others that have ended up in extreme debt and in some cases needing to fold their business.  )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
